+## Routes
+
+The existing routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales`: accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  Quantities are positive whole dish counts; soldAt must include a time zone.
+  Returns `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`, counting newly imported tickets
+  and portions sold. Previously imported tickets are skipped. All rows are
+  validated, including skipped tickets. Any invalid row or stock shortage
+  rejects the entire file with `sales_row` naming the physical CSV row
+  (header is row 1). Consumption is dated at soldAt with ref `sale:<ticket>`.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD`: returns an array
+  of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, variance }` in item id order. Days are
+  inclusive UTC days; variance is actual minus theoretical. Actual includes
+  every consume movement; theoretical uses ingredient snapshots from sales.
+  Only items with positive theoretical or actual use are returned.
