+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 with an empty `sales` collection. Each imported
+sale row stores ticket, soldAt (normalized UTC instant), dishId, qty and an
+`ingredients` snapshot of scaled itemId/qty pairs. Ticket strings identify
+imports globally; all rows of a new ticket in a file are imported together.
+Sales, stock and ledger changes commit together only after the file succeeds.
+Ingredient snapshots keep theoretical use stable when recipes change.
